# ---- Secrets and signing (never commit) ------------------------------------
# Real API keys / AdMob IDs live in these; the committed *.Sample.cs files are the
# templates. The pattern is **/ so it matches at any depth, not just the repo root.
**/Configuration/ApiKeys.cs
**/Configuration/AdMobConfig.cs
*.keystore
*.jks
*.pfx
*.p12
*.snk
google-services.json
*.pem
.env
.env.*
secrets.json

